            </div>
            <div class="scroll-down">
                <i class="arrow"></i>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="contentContainer">
        <div class="aboutSection">
            <h2>About BookCase</h2>
            <p class="quote">"A library is not a luxury but one of the necessities of life." — Henry Ward Beecher</p>
                
            <div class="missionSection">
                <div class="textContent">
                    <h3>Our Mission</h3>
                    <p>At BookCase, we believe in the transformative power of reading. Our mission is to make literature, research, and knowledge accessible to everyone, everywhere. We're not just a digital library; we're a community of passionate readers, learners, and thinkers.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="iconBox">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">auto_stories</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="valuesSection">
                <h3>What We Offer</h3>
                <div class="valueCards">
                    <div class="valueCard">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">menu_book</span>
                        <h4>Vast Collection</h4>
                        <p>Access thousands of books across all genres, from classics to contemporary bestsellers.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="valueCard">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">science</span>
                        <h4>Research Papers</h4>
                        <p>Explore cutting-edge research in AI, physics, medicine, and environmental science.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="valueCard">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">article</span>
                        <h4>Insightful Articles</h4>
                        <p>Stay informed with articles on technology, education, health, and culture.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="valueCard">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">favorite</span>
                        <h4>Personal Library</h4>
                        <p>Save your favorites and build your own curated collection.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="storySection">
                <h3>Our Story</h3>
                <div class="storyContent">
                    <p>Founded by book lovers for book lovers, BookCase started with a simple idea: to create a space where knowledge flows freely and reading becomes a journey of discovery. We've grown from a small collection to a comprehensive digital library, but our core values remain unchanged.</p>
                    <p>We're committed to supporting readers at every stage of their journey, whether you're a student researching for a thesis, a professional seeking industry insights, or simply someone who loves getting lost in a good story.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="teamSection">
                <h3>Join Our Community</h3>
                <p>Become part of a global community of readers and learners. Share your thoughts, discover new perspectives, and let books transform your world.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
